  {
   "tag": "h1",
   "text": "When always trying to be the Bigger Person becomes too heavy",
   "section": "comp-m04zcdxw"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Be done with being the Bigger Person?",
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "A softer way forward.",
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Many people reach a point where they say quietly but frankly, “I’m tired of being the bigger person.” Not out of pettiness, but out of exhaustion.",
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Exhaustion from carrying the emotional weight, holding the peace, or forgiving when it almost always feels one-sided. If this resonates, you’re not alone, and you’re not wrong for feeling this way. This moment is often the beginning of real healing.",
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "When ‘Being the Bigger Person’ Becomes Too Heavy",
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "What begins as kindness can turn into self-forgetting when you:",
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Silence your own needs",
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Avoid conflict out of fear",
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Carry others' emotions as if they’re your own responsibility",
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Give without receiving",
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "This isn’t failure, it’s a sign your spirit is asking for a new way.",
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "You do not need to rise above everything. True spiritual alignment isn’t endless tolerance, it’s honouring your intuition, your boundaries, and your emotional truth. Your energy is sacred. Your needs matter. Your voice is and should be allowed.",
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Now you would ask where does hypnotherapy fit in. Hypnotherapy gently works with the subconscious to release old patterns of over-giving and self-abandonment. It can help you:",
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Let go of beliefs that peace must be earned",
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Build calm, healthy boundaries",
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Soothe guilt and emotional overwhelm",
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Reconnect with your inner guidance",
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "You’re not ending your kindness and compassion, just your exhaustion. Choosing yourself doesn’t make you less spiritual or compassionate. It makes you whole.",
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "If you’re ready to release the weight you’ve been carrying, hypnotherapy can guide you back to alignment, to a life where peace doesn’t require self-sacrifice.",
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "You deserve relationships that honour your energy. You deserve to feel grounded, balanced, and free.",
   "section": ""
  },
